<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB - no buyer T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	   BASIS	 MONTH		PREV</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	    30/25 D	 April	     30/25 D</p>
<p> May		28/25 D	 May		 30/25 D</p>
<p> July	     4 D/5 P	 July		4 D/5 P</p>
<p> August	   10/15 P	 August	    10/20 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	   BASIS	 MONTH	   PREV</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	    21/17 D	 March	     20/19 D</p>
<p> May		21/17 D	 May		 20/18 D</p>
<p> July	     22/18 D	 July		22/18 D</p>
<p> August	     8/5 D	 August		9/6 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	   BASIS	 MONTH	   PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	   100/70 D	 April	    100/70 D</p>
<p> May	    140/110 D	 May	     140/110 D</p>
<p> July	   150/120 D	 July	    150/120 D</p>
<p> August	 150/120 D	 August	  150/120 D</p>
